# Build-time-only files: never fetched by the deployed site at runtime, only
# used locally to generate index.html and the products/industries trees.
# Excluding them (rather than relying on robots.txt/noindex, which only ask
# well-behaved crawlers not to index -- they don't stop a scraper fetching the
# file directly) means they 404 on the live domain instead of serving.
Balaji Enterprises.dc.html
build-catalogue-pages.py
build-index.py
github.md
product-photo-filenames.txt
image-slot.js
industries-map.json
indexnow.py
